close_reason: "pm package list lists the installed packages, and every package listing takes one --fields contract"
contract_change:
  api: "pm package list / pm packages list / pm extension list, pm package explore and manage rows, and the SDK StaticExtensionInventoryEntry/StaticExtensionInventoryResult types"
  before: pm package list was an alias of pm package catalog and returned the bundled catalog (details.packages); explore and manage rows embedded the full contributions map; inventory rows had no update column
  after: "pm package list is an alias of pm package inventory and returns the installed packages of the selected scope (extensions[] with an update column, plus updates_available); pm package catalog returns the bundled catalog; explore and manage rows leave contributions out unless --fields asks for it; list, explore, manage and catalog share one --fields contract"
  migrate: "Scripts that read the bundled catalog from pm package list switch to pm package catalog (same rows and --fields); readers of contributions in explore or manage rows pass --fields with contributions, or use pm package describe"
